ARA, SADAO</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FRINGS RAINER BRUNO</name><address><country>DE</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUGGER CHRISTINE</name><address><country>DE</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>GRAHE GERWALD</name><address><country>DE</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAGASHIMA YUTAKA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NEGISHI MAKOTO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OGAWA SHINJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OHNISHI HIROYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>PITHART CORNELIA</name><address><country>DE</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAKATSU HARUYOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAKEHARA SADAO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FRINGS, RAINER, BRUNO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUGGER, CHRISTINE</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>GRAHE, GERWALD</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAGASHIMA, YUTAKA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NEGISHI, MAKOTO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OGAWA, SHINJI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHNISHI, HIROYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>PITHART, CORNELIA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKATSU, HARUYOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKEHARA, SADAO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A decahydronaphthalene derivative represented by general formula (I), a liquid-crystal composition containing the derivative; and a liquid-crystal element containing the composition.  The decahydronaphthalene derivative, which is a novel compound, can be extremely easily produced even on an industrial scale as shown in Examples. When added to a base liquid crystal in a small amount, the derivative not only widens the nematic-phase temperature range but can improve various properties of the liquid-crystal material. The derivative has excellent compatibility with base liquid crystals currently in general use as nematic liquid crystals.  Therefore, it is suitable for use in various liquid-crystal display elements required to operate in a wide temperature range and is extremely useful as a material for liquid crystals.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Cette invention se rapporte à un dérivé de décahydronaphtalène, représenté par la formule générale (I), à une composition de cristaux liquides contenant ce dérivé; et à un élément à base de cristaux liquides contenant cette composition. Ce dérivé de décahydronaphtalène, qui est un composé nouveau, peut être produit de façon extrêmement aisée, même à une échelle industrielle, comme représenté dans les exemples. Lorsqu'il est ajouté à un cristal liquide de base en petites quantités, ce dérivé non seulement élargit la plage de températures de la phase nématique mais améliore en outre diverses propriétés du matériau à base de cristaux liquides. Ce dérivé présente une excellente compatibilité avec les cristaux liquides de base qui sont actuellement utilisés de façon générale comme cristaux liquides nématiques. Il est par conséquent approprié dans divers éléments d'affichage à cristaux liquides sollicités pour fonctionner dans une large plage de températures et il est extrêmement utile comme matériau pour cristaux liquides.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>